and we ask you guys

00:00:15.501 --> 00:00:16.901
to respond to that topic.

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:20.968
This week, I sent out a hashtag,
#AddAWordRuinAHorrorMovie.

00:00:20.968 --> 00:00:22.868
I asked you to take
a horror movie title,

00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:25.067
add one word
to change the meaning.

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:26.434
Within minutes,
it was the number-one

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:28.067
trending topic in the U.S.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:31.868
Number-one on Twitter.
So thank you for playing along.

00:00:31.868 --> 00:00:34.000
Now I thought Jack and I would
share some of our favorite

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.400
"Add a word, ruin a horror
movie" tweets from you guys.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.701
You ready for this?
-Yes.

00:00:37.701 --> 00:00:38.767
-All right, here we go.
I'll go first.

00:00:38.767 --> 00:00:41.467
This first is from
@patsysweetie.

00:00:41.467 --> 00:00:42.801
She says...

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:47.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:48.667
I like that kid.
-That kid's cute.

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:52.000
-Yeah, he liked "cone."
-It's got the juice.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.267
-Okay.
This one's -- you read this.

00:00:55.267 --> 00:00:57.734
-This is from @Joanosborne.

00:00:57.734 --> 00:00:58.901
-The real -- by the way,
the singer,

00:00:58.901 --> 00:01:01.601
the real Joan Osborne
