00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.234
-Yeah, that's pretty good.
That's decently scary.

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:14.567
Yeah, yeah.
This one's from @Webhead62.

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:15.901
He says...

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:19.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:19.501 --> 00:01:22.067
[ As Statham ] "Oi, you're not
wearing a hockey mask, mate?

00:01:22.067 --> 00:01:24.834
Huh?
You like killing people, huh?

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:26.901
On Friday the 13th?"
No, oh, no.

00:01:26.901 --> 00:01:30.234
"When it's a nightmare.
Oi.

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:32.467
Oi, you like --
you like nightmares?"

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:34.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:36.234
[ Normal voice ] Jason Statham,
I sat next to him once

00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:38.100
at some charity event
we were at.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:41.501
And I sat next to him,
and he goes, "Oi, what you do?"

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:44.534
[ Laughter ]
I go, "I'm a talk-show host."

00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:46.767
He goes, "I don't
really like chat shows."

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:48.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:49.968
I go, "Well, it was
nice to meet you, man."

00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:51.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.033 --> 00:01:52.234
I go, "You know,
we don't have to talk.

00:01:52.234 --> 00:01:53.467
We can play games on the show
or whatever."

00:01:53.467 --> 00:01:55.934
He goes, "You play games?"

00:01:55.934 --> 00:01:57.434
I go, "Yeah, yeah,
we play games."

00:01:57.434 --> 00:01:58.734
"What kind of games
do you play?"

00:01:58.734 --> 00:02:00.868
I go, "We play anything.
We play beer pong.

00:02:00.868 --> 00:02:05.133
We play water war."
He's like, "What's water war?"

00:02:05.133 --> 00:02:07.300
I go, "It's like war
but you throw water."

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.033
He's like, "I'll play a game."

00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:10.834
[ Laughter ]
I go, "All right."

00:02:10.834 --> 00:02:12.801
And then, the next week,
he came on the show.

00:02:12.801 --> 00:02:14.501
Like, I don't even think
he was supposed to be here,

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:15.734
but he just showed up.
We were like, "All right.

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:17.267
Come on, on."
-He like it?

00:02:17.267 --> 00:02:18.467
-He was so funny.

00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:20.601
We were laughing
like little kids,

00:02:20.601 --> 00:02:23.267
and I had to throw water
in Jason Statham's face.

00:02:23.267 --> 00:02:24.434
-Must have been amazing.

00:02:24.434 --> 00:02:25.601
-It was the most
frightening thing

00:02:25.601 --> 00:02:27.367
I've ever done in my lifetime.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.367 --> 00:02:29.267
'Cause at one point, I go,
"He's gonna punch me."

00:02:29.267 --> 00:02:31.701
I think he was balling his fist.

00:02:31.701 --> 00:02:32.934
But then
he just started laughing.

00:02:32.934 --> 00:02:34.334
We had the best time ever.

00:02:34.334 --> 00:02:36.434
I love Jason Statham.
He's invited back any time.

00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:37.868
-Shout-out Jason Statham.
-Yeah, he's a good man.

00:02:37.868 --> 00:02:40.834
Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:40.834 --> 00:02:42.734
